## Sleep descent: pink bed swelling 5 -> 25, carriers 220 -> 180 Hz,
## beats 10 -> 2 Hz. Ends in deep delta. Headphones on, lights out.

off: -
alpha-one: pink/5 220+10/15
alpha-two: pink/10 220+8/15
theta-one: pink/15 180+6/10
theta-two: pink/20 180+4/10
delta: pink/25 180+2/5

